WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:12.420
Features: extra sections for your kind of business (appointments, shop, courses, events, shipments…); each one you turn on adds its own menu to the panel.

2
00:00:12.968 --> 00:00:17.170
In "Your business features", click a feature to read what it does.

3
00:00:17.717 --> 00:00:23.430
Turn on only the features you really use; a shorter menu means simpler work.

4
00:00:23.981 --> 00:00:28.570
After turning one on, open its new menu; it has its own guide.

5
00:00:29.122 --> 00:00:34.030
Turning a feature off doesn't delete its data; it only hides the menu.
